{"id":"n75195-2-7","stage":5,"title":"제치다 · 去掉","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n75195-2-7-1","ko":"나를 제쳐 두고 어디를 가겠다는 거야?","zh":"你打算抛下我一个人去哪儿？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나를","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나를","audio":"/audio/4225b1c78642e45b4068.mp3"}},{"text":"제쳐","meaning":"去掉，删除，撇开","explanation":"제치다：去掉，删除，撇开；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"제치다","audio":"/audio/f647531cb4e25251a429.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75195","senseId":"2","lemma":"제치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제쳐","audio":"/audio/9a3262734c35932347de.mp3"}},{"text":"두고","meaning":"撇下，丢下，落","explanation":"두다：撇下，丢下，落；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"두다","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67470","senseId":"3","lemma":"두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"두고","audio":"/audio/b825f2c9e380ab51c58d.mp3"}},{"text":"어디를","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디를","audio":"/audio/30dd6318827dd406d486.mp3"}},{"text":"가겠다는","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；다는：引用陈述内容并修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가겠다는","audio":"/audio/b2684992e29a540d81bf.mp3"}},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"4","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"f647531cb4e25251","term":"제치다","zh":"去掉，删除，撇开","audio":"/audio/f647531cb4e25251a429.mp3","entryId":"75195","definition":"从一定的对象或范围里除去。","pronunciation":["제치다"]},{"id":"531b2c3977c491e8","term":"두다","zh":"撇下，丢下，落","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3","entryId":"67470","definition":"不带走，遗留或丢弃。","pronunciation":["두다"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/60f56df9d7068dacd120.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n75195-2-7-2","ko":"오해야. 안 그래도 지금 같이 가자고 하려고 했어.","zh":"是误会啦。我本来就打算现在一起去的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오해야.","meaning":"误解，误会","explanation":"오해：误解，误会；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"오해","audio":"/audio/a317fe4511680982e2e2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22033","senseId":"1","lemma":"오해","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오해야","audio":"/audio/3fcde0e73deb1134ab86.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"그래도","meaning":"“그리하여도(即便如此)”的缩略语。","explanation":"그래도：“그리하여도(即便如此)”的缩略语。","readings":[{"term":"그래도","audio":"/audio/82bd547e58bb6509909c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36264","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래도","audio":"/audio/82bd547e58bb6509909c.mp3"}},{"text":"지금","meaning":"现在","explanation":"지금：现在","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62522","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}},{"text":"같이","meaning":"一起，一同","explanation":"같이：一起，一同","readings":[{"term":"같이","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26799","senseId":"1","lemma":"같이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같이","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3"}},{"text":"가자고","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；자고：转述一起行动的提议：“提议、说一起……”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가자고","audio":"/audio/95eafe67f1a65b620d67.mp3"}},{"text":"하려고","meaning":"说、转述（引用前面的话）","explanation":"하다：说、转述（引用前面的话）；려고：表示意图或打算：“想要、打算”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하려고","audio":"/audio/761078da9d37d7327667.mp3"}},{"text":"했어.","meaning":"打算做（-려고 하다）","explanation":"하다：打算做（-려고 하다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했어","audio":"/audio/76f3569b074c48dd5200.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a317fe4511680982","term":"오해","zh":"误解，误会","audio":"/audio/a317fe4511680982e2e2.mp3","entryId":"22033","definition":"错误地了解或解释某个东西。","pronunciation":["오ː해"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"82bd547e58bb6509","term":"그래도","zh":"“그리하여도(即便如此)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/82bd547e58bb6509909c.mp3","entryId":"36264","definition":"“그리하여도(即便如此)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"df159f47a890ff65","term":"지금","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3","entryId":"62522","definition":"指正在说话的此时。","pronunciation":["지금"]},{"id":"d44da011993f2a6e","term":"같이","zh":"一起，一同","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3","entryId":"26799","definition":"两个以上同时。","pronunciation":["가치"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"说、转述（引用前面的话）；打算做（-려고 하다）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"说、转述（引用前面的话）","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/69b593e0cbaa2895a547.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.542,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=75195","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":172,"sequenceScore":3.3687,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是误会啦。我本来就打算现在一起去的。","我不知道这次汇报该交给谁来做。","你打算抛下我一个人去哪儿？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["是误会啦。我本来就打算现在一起去的。","你打算抛下我一个人去哪儿？","我不知道这次汇报该交给谁来做。"],"answer":0}]}
